        "expectedOutput": "+----+-------+\n| id | type  |\n+----+-------+\n| 1  | Root  |\n| 2  | Inner |\n| 3  | Leaf  |\n| 4  | Leaf  |\n| 5  | Leaf  |\n+----+-------+",
